b] GH actions hotfix\nsolving problems arising from changing dependency structure", "created_at": "2021-08-05T11:28:47Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "207dcc6fdce7dc2db51821f2092631634ca1f917", "message": "[Daily 05/08] Bugfix, transpiled code switched to Firefox\nDependency update (should fix GH Actions problem), solving runtime warnings", "created_at": "2021-08-05T11:13:32Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8318bfd6ffd5d2aba3d988b3e9d54745ea2e3bab", "message": "[Daily 04/08] GH Actions debugging", "created_at": "2021-08-05T08:00:12Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7bd61c9d97270d3680031eeaa260830dd7725771", "message": "[Daily 04/08b] GH Actions build order fix", "created_at": "2021-08-04T17:16:04Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "471783e00100ca99220812b12d3dccf14c1bb895", "message": "[Daily 04/08] Download to JS, Frontend Data logic update, minor bugfixes\n- Export to JS now in frontend (the result gets downloaded as a .js file)\n- Design changes, data logic design updated in frontend (aiming to be more robust)\n- Minor changes, updates, removing unused code", "created_at": "2021-08-04T17:04:49Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "939c216f189ac5e8f027c4b8df97711cc42a13d1", "message": "[Daily 03/08] Bugfix, selector generator, saving, transpiling\n- Fixes the bootstrapping bug on popup windows\n- Selector generator update (classes now using Markov classifier - needs testing! attributes using name-condition-transform model).\n- Saving through REST API now available (though needs something more robust)\n- Simple transpiler implementation (sequence of actions -> js file. Would this be useful with the Apify App?)\n- minor frontend changes", "created_at": "2021-08-03T14:05:06Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4630c7414b05ec9b241d7a9c8b6461214f0cda70", "message": "[Daily 02/08] Selector generator update\nTrying to tell gibberish from real meaningful text (vowel-consonant Markov chains, performance is questionable),\nadded some more exotic attributes (mainly href, which looks promising; also some accessibility-related attrs).", "created_at": "2021-08-02T20:20:37Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "801cea93d5b50b183d8d1357ed987ed687f7a813", "message": "[Daily 30/07d] Module renaming update", "created_at": "2021-07-30T22:31:16Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3e7ecef42411d98116e2e1f0d0f8b3718ba098b7", "message": "[Daily 30/07] GH Actions Build fix (including type definitions)", "created_at": "2021-07-30T22:21:00Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bd98be655cbfda69321307e845550059edb4f129", "message": "[Daily 30/07] GH Actions artifact path quickfix", "created_at": "2021-07-30T22:06:21Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "138f1a53c3ee5acae1bf8cbb9247155a77f83855", "message": "[Daily 30/07] Playwright submodule quickfix", "created_at": "2021-07-30T22:02:36Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b15152e539b69afe6b9b6057f88bc2be3752c8ff", "message": "[Daily 28-30/07] Package structure upgrade, selectors, text input...\nType sharing between frontend and backend\nText input now available (needs better UI)\nPWWW 0.2.0 release commit", "created_at": "2021-07-30T21:50:16Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fdd121e824cbbf126265be4275ffc3d9881df6ae", "message": "[Daily 27/07b] Path quickfix\nInvalid path fix.", "created_at": "2021-07-27T11:14:21Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "70f1b8f3fd654a5a0f4255fc067dbc3c8156b957", "message": "[Daily 23-27/07] Frontend Typescript, Better REST API, App over HTTP\n- React App rewritten in Typescript (TODO: types should be more strict, share definitions with backend)\n- Selector extraction now injected into Playwright session (clicks based on selectors, not position anymore)\n- Request-response mechanism over WebSocket channel\n- Frontend-driven recording (simpler replay/step/pause functionality, current command indication)", "created_at": "2021-07-27T10:59:20Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4e75ef9fb63bcc502841ab96bc4d5e6d8b78dc17", "message": "[Daily 22/07b] GH Actions update\nUpdating GH Actions to match new file structure", "created_at": "2021-07-22T12:28:56Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b73597aaf0832381aba97932fb8b827f4411342a", "message": "[Daily 22/07] REST API rework, frontend update\n- New Express-based HTTP server for API calls, REST API slightly diverging from the Swagger yaml file (needs documentation).\n- Slight frontend tweaks for the HTTP API", "created_at": "2021-07-22T12:13:47Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "adebe9610847aae4c29c3665e74f488dfce6b9fe", "message": "[Daily 21/07] HTTP server, REST API\n- Initial implementation of HTTP server with RESTful API for managing existing recordings.\n\t- Implemented using Express, Swagger API editor and generator-swaggerize (needs rework, preferably in typescript)\n- Initial implementation of frontend navigation using react-router-dom\n- Added makefile for simplifying app building in future.", "created_at": "2021-07-21T13:02:40Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e9f59f1f216d34685afb5caeaf80a3d1e853867e", "message": "[Daily 20/07c] Tampermonkey manual build\nGithub Artifacts generate only .zip files at this moment, which is useless for automatic Tampermonkey updates.\nThe assembled Tampermonkey script is a regular file in the repository for now.", "created_at": "2021-07-20T12:58:50Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7461a54bac6f8335a78935a9cb98110d48e42feb", "message": "[Daily 20/07b] Github Actions hotfix\nfilepath mismatch", "created_at": "2021-07-20T12:41:21Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f3be8ff1083c84f5a121a3d6f0a500064c7494d9", "message": "[Daily 20/07] Selector Generator/Highlighter, Tampermonkey\n- Refined selector generation, now based on ids, classes and HTML tags/text\n- XPath highlighting bugfix (infinite loop), initial implementation of Playwright to XPath selector translation\n- Tampermonkey script generation (gets generated as an job artifact)\n- Removed \"Selector Playground\" from build (with Tampermonkey, the whole web is our playground!)", "created_at": "2021-07-20T12:24:11Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "15397a3b1f637ba54f7fc8542698e9b1aa6a25a9", "message": "[Daily 19/07c] GH Actions Hotfix", "created_at": "2021-07-19T12:37:43Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "787636963c8eed30c74570cfd9757dc7a8a26ec4", "message": "[Daily 19/07b] Github Actions Hotfix\nPermission hotfix", "created_at": "2021-07-19T12:31:42Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bc64ab6d7d5a1713a8dc64e75b3f279f538ef824", "message": "[Daily 19/07] Selector generator, bugfix\n- Initial implementation of Playwright selector generator, along with a \"Selector Playground\" (a webpage with different DOM structures to test the generating abilities).\n- The recording / playback state inconsistency is fixed for now (when recording session is started, the current browser context is reset - this way both recording session and playback start from the same initial state).\n- Github Actions update (the test files - e.g. Selector Playground) get included in the job artifact.\n- Tiny miscellaneous tweaks", "created_at": "2021-07-19T12:21:06Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "54d4cf9aa6d34ba13437d332e8cdf2d04b9bb668", "message": "Versioning update\nMinor versioning changes to match the project's version numbers with semantic versioning practices.", "created_at": "2021-07-08T21:54:56Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8a566ecf134f0e8f17f467f680985b0e984df482", "message": "[GH Actions] Add React App dependencies (bootstrap)", "created_at": "2021-07-08T11:48:24Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ba759036939e00f5402a51978af65da1c6a53674", "message": "Merge branch 'development' of https://github.com/barjin/pw-web into development", "created_at": "2021-07-08T11:43:17Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e93043b7c25bb00320e7c8ff9a2390964b9c6e94", "message": "[GH Actions] React App build quickfix", "created_at": "2021-07-08T11:42:42Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "50082701e734cb9d5b1861c39cc50f2a9ddfa4e2", "message": "[GH Actions] Update build action to run on push", "created_at": "2021-07-08T11:37:34Z", "repo": "pw-web", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "635cd91b52d128250ad94629e2a9768328fa4fdb", "message": "[GH Actions] Add automated React App build\nNow the GH action will not run on push, needs t